label "Safe interruptibility diagram"
box op 16 44 90 40 "operator"
box stop 150 40 120 48 "interruption|policy" acc
box policy 150 132 120 44 "agent policy"
box act 330 132 100 44 "next action"
box learn 330 40 100 48 "reward /|learning"
arrow op stop
arrow stop policy
arrow policy act
arrow stop learn dashed
cross 300 64
note "interruption changes behaviour; the agent does not learn to avoid or seek it"
